      "explanation": "Because \\(x<2\\), the expression \\(x-2\\) is negative. Its absolute value is therefore its opposite:\n\\[\np=|x-2|=-(x-2)=2-x.\n\\]\nRearranging gives \\(x=2-p\\), so\n\\[\nx-p=(2-p)-p=\\boxed{2-2p}.\n\\]\nThe answer is choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
